  "question": {
    "text": "A liquid in a beaker has temperature $\\theta(t)$ at time $t$ and $\\theta_0$ is temperature of surroundings, then according to Newton's law of cooling the correct graph between $\\log _e\\left(\\theta-\\theta_0\\right)$ and $t$ is",
